This version reads `profile` and `profileIndex` into locals once and checks `profile` before touching `profileIndex`. It returns the same values with no other side effects. Any speedup will be small, because the original is already just a couple of checks and one load.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumSubFields(void) const
{
    const auto* p = profile;
    if (p == NULL)
        return 0;
    const auto idx = profileIndex;
    if (idx >= p->numFields)
        return 0;
    return p->fields[idx].numSubFields;
}
```